 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Uruwashi No Kotei Heika No Unmei No Hanayome Ni Erabareteshimatta Nodesuga, Mada Shigoto Ga Shitainode Himitsudesu ！"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "麗しの皇帝陛下の運命の花嫁に選ばれてしまったのですが、まだ仕事がしたいので秘密です！"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Was Chosen as the Beautiful Emperor’s Fated Mate. But I’d Like to Focus on Work, So Let’s Keep It a Secret!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Tianna, a devoted court apothecary, lives to save lives through her work.\nJust as her hard work finally earns her a promotion, a mysterious mark appears on her body—one that identifies her as the \"fated bride\" of the elegant and powerful Emperor Safir! As the imperial court launches a massive search for this destined partner, Tianna, determined to keep working as an apothecary, decides to hide her true identity.\n\nBut fate has other plans—she’s suddenly assigned as the emperor’s exclusive apothecary, putting her closer to discovery than ever before…!",
   "ja": "宮廷薬師・ティアンナは人々を救うため、日々仕事に励んでいた。努力が認められ昇進を果たした矢先、彼女の体に“特別な印”が現れる。それは皇帝サフィールの“運命の花嫁”であることを示すもので……!? 花嫁の捜索が宮廷を挙げて行われる中、薬師の仕事をしたいと願うティアンナは正体を隠すことを決意。だが、あろう事かティアンナは多忙を極めるサフィール専属のお薬係に任命されてしまい――…。"
  },
